# API contract (`@repo/api`)

## Ownership

| Concern | Location |
| --- | --- |
| DTO, entities, Swagger metadata | `packages/api` |
| Nest wiring, services, controllers | `apps/api` |
| Types / keys for dev | `apps/web` → `"@repo/api": "workspace:*"` (devDep) |

## Rules

- **Do not** duplicate DTOs in `apps/api` or `apps/web` when shared contract exists
- **Do not** expose raw Prisma models as HTTP contract
- FE Zod schemas may mirror DTO fields — keep in sync when contract changes
- Breaking field rename → `BREAKING_API` escalation

## Change workflow

1. Edit `packages/api`
2. `pnpm --filter @repo/api build`
3. Update `apps/api` services/controllers
4. Update FE forms/types if consumer exists
5. Fullstack quality gates — [fullstack-quality-gates.mdc](./fullstack-quality-gates.mdc)

